  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place potato, Mumbai spice blend and brown mustard seeds on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d692c30d33981f9979af/step-69719e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Thinly slice red radish.\n• Grate carrot (see ingredients).\n• Cut paneer into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d692c30d33981f9979af/step-07d83710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When potato has 5 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook paneer until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce, turning paneer to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d692c30d33981f9979af/step-dacf7d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber, radish, carrot and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide sweet chilli paneer, Bombay potatoes and cucumber salad between plates.\n• Sprinkle over crushed peanuts and serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6874d692c30d33981f9979af/step-5ec1fe30.jpg"
    }
  ]
